From: Onur Demir <demir-onur@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 21:49:41 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 08/22] nginx_ops delete: silinecek path old_input_path'ten
 (Portal envanter listesi), yoksa input_path
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- non_prod_delete_spa/prod_delete: old_input_path > input_path onceligi, ayri ad
  (spa_path_in / del_path_in; extra_vars set_fact ile ezilemez), bos dizge eski ada duser
- spa_facts: path kaynagi spa_path_in > input_path
- update: bos old_input_path input_path'e duser (default('', true))
- README §2b: Portal'da alanlarin envanterden secilmesi tablosu; tests/check_nginx_ops_delete_path.py

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
